@startuml timeline-reactivity
' SPEC: _spec/apps/starchess/architecture/timeline-reactivity.puml
' purpose: Who invalidates on TIMELINE_COMMIT field groups (shell ∥ timeline).
!include ../../../themes/proveo.puml

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

title StarChess · Timeline reactivity\nTIMELINE_COMMIT → shell ∥ timeline → readers

queue "TIMELINE_COMMIT" as COMMIT <<async>>

database "timeline signal\ncues · playing · progress\ndying · trails · display*" as TLS <<db>>
database "matchShell signal\nphase · snaps · economies" as SHELL <<db>>
component "no shell set\nunchanged shell fields" as SKIP <<host>>

component "useCombatOverlays" as UCO <<app>>
component "displayedSnapshot\ndisplay* only" as DISP <<app>>
component "TurnBar / ResourceBar\nDualNav" as HUD <<app>>
component "StarChessBoard\nglyphs / fog" as BOARD <<app>>
database "CombatCueFrame" as FRAME <<db>>
component "CombatOverlayRoot\nlayers" as VFX <<app>>

COMMIT ARROW_MAIN TLS : playingIds / progress\ndying / trails
COMMIT ARROW_MAIN TLS : displayPlacement\nlives / mines
COMMIT ARROW_MAIN SHELL : live placement\n(non-review)
COMMIT ARROW_OPTIONAL SKIP : shell fields\nunchanged

TLS ARROW_MAIN UCO
TLS ARROW_OPTIONAL DISP : display*
SHELL ARROW_MAIN HUD
SHELL ARROW_MAIN DISP
SHELL ARROW_MAIN BOARD
DISP ARROW_MAIN BOARD

UCO ARROW_MAIN FRAME
FRAME ARROW_MAIN VFX

note bottom
  Overlay cue ticks must not wake HUD.
  ""displayedSnapshot"" reads shell + timeline **display*** only —
  not playingIds / moveProgress / trails.
  See ""timeline-perf.puml"" · ""timeline-commit-batching.mmd"".
end note

@enduml
